WEBVTT

00:02.090 --> 00:03.720
I...

00:09.040 --> 00:12.900
H... Help...

00:14.770 --> 00:15.660
Philomela!

00:34.750 --> 00:39.100
Don't you want to meet 
your mother and father?

01:10.400 --> 01:11.880
What...

01:15.600 --> 01:18.720
It's grown back.

01:18.720 --> 01:20.300
Everything but my fingers.

01:39.610 --> 01:41.050
You're leaving, huh?

01:42.370 --> 01:45.450
Not that I care what happens to you.

01:46.400 --> 01:48.600
But I think you're gonna have a rough time.

02:11.050 --> 02:13.270
You'll be home again soon...

02:14.730 --> 02:15.900
Adam.

03:51.860 --> 03:52.980
Here I go.

03:59.030 --> 04:01.190
<i>I've never known...</i>

04:02.210 --> 04:05.270
<i>why I'm so powerless.</i>

04:08.790 --> 04:14.630
<i>Why I'm unable to hold Lady Philomela's 
shoulders when she's suffering so.</i>

04:30.140 --> 04:34.330
So you're the artificial fairy Adam made.

04:35.470 --> 04:39.190
Please return me to Lady Philomela.

04:39.660 --> 04:42.130
Is that your duty?

04:42.130 --> 04:44.460
That's what I was created for.

04:44.460 --> 04:48.040
Then I'll give you a different duty.

04:48.040 --> 04:49.000
No!

04:49.000 --> 04:54.180
Even if I'm programmed with a 
different duty, I belong to her.

04:54.180 --> 04:55.770
I exist for her.

04:55.770 --> 04:58.040
And I will destroy for her.

04:58.850 --> 04:59.880
Oh?

05:08.240 --> 05:12.050
He must have had neither adequate 
materials nor equipment.

05:12.050 --> 05:13.900
That boy sure is skilled.

05:14.850 --> 05:19.050
But you're still just 
a cobbled-together artificial fairy.

05:21.750 --> 05:25.020
A little tinkering ought to fix you up.

05:35.270 --> 05:37.930
<i>My consciousness is fading.</i>

05:39.030 --> 05:42.280
<i>Because of that spell,</i>

05:44.040 --> 05:45.890
<i>I failed to protect her.</i>

05:49.790 --> 05:52.120
There's another one inside.

05:52.950 --> 05:54.030
What's this?

05:54.790 --> 05:57.110
We mustn't go there yet.

06:02.930 --> 06:04.100
You...

06:04.920 --> 06:08.710
What I knew to be true has finally returned.

06:09.250 --> 06:11.170
My truth...

06:12.080 --> 06:14.090
The reason for my existence.

06:14.640 --> 06:17.020
Please, sir mage.

06:18.120 --> 06:21.430
Take me to her.

06:32.020 --> 06:34.570
<i>I'd finally had a child.</i>

06:35.770 --> 06:39.220
<i>I was more qualified than 
anyone in the household.</i>

06:41.300 --> 06:44.230
<i>My father chose me to be his heir.</i>

06:44.230 --> 06:50.680
<i>I was honored to serve as a Rickenbacker 
the way my ancestors did.</i>

06:51.260 --> 06:54.820
It's about time you adopt.

06:56.340 --> 06:58.580
You're accomplished.

06:58.580 --> 07:01.390
You're going to need someone 
to take your place.

07:01.390 --> 07:02.420
It's fine.

07:02.420 --> 07:05.860
No one in this day and age will require 
the child to be yours by birth.

07:07.160 --> 07:08.080
Yes, sir.

07:09.380 --> 07:13.570
<i>For the first time in my life,
 I hesitated in my response to my master.</i>

07:15.430 --> 07:17.840
To think she can't bear an heir...

07:17.840 --> 07:19.870
The ancestors would be disappointed.

07:19.870 --> 07:22.630
She has the talent and the 
competence to be the master,

07:22.630 --> 07:24.200
and yet she's a failure.

07:27.110 --> 07:30.340
<i>It wasn't that I wanted a child of my own.</i>

07:30.990 --> 07:35.430
<i>But if I couldn't have one, 
my peers wouldn't approve of me.</i>

07:35.430 --> 07:37.230
<i>They'd say I was inferior.</i>

07:37.230 --> 07:40.130
<i>That I was flawed for
 having a broken womb.</i>

07:41.110 --> 07:44.160
<i>I am not inferior.</i>

07:44.160 --> 07:46.600
<i>I'm not a failure.</i>

07:59.020 --> 08:02.540
<i>I named my son Adam.</i>

08:02.790 --> 08:03.950
Did you hear?

08:03.950 --> 08:05.960
The son-in-law suddenly died, apparently.

08:06.430 --> 08:07.710
Was he sick?

08:08.080 --> 08:10.010
I heard he suffered quite severely.

08:10.010 --> 08:12.450
Well, they have a child now.

08:12.450 --> 08:14.490
No reason to fret.

08:17.520 --> 08:20.010
<i>The wet nurse raised my son.</i>

08:20.010 --> 08:24.180
<i>But he soon began to follow me around.</i>

08:53.220 --> 08:57.900
Mother, um, where are you headed to?

08:58.830 --> 09:00.830
Would you like to join me?

09:01.680 --> 09:02.730
Yes.

09:05.320 --> 09:06.540
What do you want?

09:06.540 --> 09:08.310
Oh... nothing.

09:11.240 --> 09:15.860
<i>Seeing how small and hopeless 
he was, I couldn't help but find him</i>

09:15.860 --> 09:20.680
<i>irresistibly adorable and 
intensely repulsive.</i>

09:30.910 --> 09:36.080
<i>This hopeless creature grew 
up the way I'd wished.</i>

09:54.470 --> 09:58.540
I'm thinking of using that test 
subject for a long-term experiment.

09:59.010 --> 10:02.030
You can trust me to dispose 
of it when I'm done,

10:02.790 --> 10:03.870
Mother.

10:05.320 --> 10:08.010
<i>So I didn't think much of it.</i>

10:09.980 --> 10:10.980
<i>Mother.</i>

10:12.010 --> 10:13.240
Adam!

10:17.210 --> 10:19.140
What nonsense is this?

10:19.140 --> 10:21.820
Who talked you into this?!

10:21.820 --> 10:22.800
<i>Beats me.</i>

10:23.940 --> 10:25.860
It's that girl!

10:29.070 --> 10:31.080
<i>I searched for him.</i>

10:31.080 --> 10:33.590
<i>He belongs to me.</i>

10:37.040 --> 10:41.430
<i>I was told there wasn't so much 
left of him as a speck of dust.</i>

10:41.430 --> 10:45.920
<i>That after he'd shot himself, 
he collapsed like a pillar of salt.</i>

10:45.920 --> 10:47.410
Miss Lizbeth.

10:51.400 --> 10:53.680
<i>Her face was a lot like that creature.</i>

10:53.900 --> 10:56.750
<i>But she took on an unfamiliar color.</i>

10:57.990 --> 10:59.230
Are you scared?

10:59.690 --> 11:00.770
Then...

11:02.350 --> 11:07.960
Forget about any memories 
that make you miss them!

11:09.430 --> 11:11.090
<i>I despised her.</i>

11:11.800 --> 11:13.640
U-Um...

11:14.920 --> 11:16.020
Grandmother.

11:16.020 --> 11:18.490
I completed the puzzle.

11:18.490 --> 11:19.580
On my own.

11:21.580 --> 11:24.090
There's nothing impressive about that.

11:24.090 --> 11:26.620
Don't waste my time with such trite news.

11:27.610 --> 11:28.910
I'm sorry.

11:32.530 --> 11:36.000
<i>Everything about her 
seemed inferior to Adam.</i>

11:43.160 --> 11:44.510
<i>The same hair.</i>

11:44.840 --> 11:46.900
<i>Flimsy arms and legs.</i>

11:47.160 --> 11:49.010
<i>A hesitant voice.</i>

11:50.150 --> 11:52.320
<i>She's so much like him.</i>

11:58.260 --> 11:59.710
<i>And yet, this isn't it.</i>

11:59.710 --> 12:00.940
<i>This isn't it...</i>

12:01.340 --> 12:05.030
This isn't what I want!

12:18.430 --> 12:19.840
Philomela...

12:34.600 --> 12:36.440
It's not an order.

12:36.440 --> 12:37.880
It's a request, I guess.

12:37.880 --> 12:39.880
Want to make some together sometime?

12:39.880 --> 12:41.620
I'm asking about what <i>you</i> want!

12:42.500 --> 12:43.460
Stop it!

12:43.460 --> 12:44.900
You're amazing, Philomela.

12:44.900 --> 12:48.640
But even if you make a mistake or 
you fail, you can always try again.

12:48.640 --> 12:51.860
Do something and say whatever you want!

12:52.270 --> 12:53.360
Stop!

12:54.040 --> 12:55.200
Please!

12:58.320 --> 12:59.750
Greedy child.

13:10.740 --> 13:17.720
I must sacrifice the magic power that's been 
gathered to summon the depicted divinity.

13:17.720 --> 13:19.600
And to that end...

13:22.940 --> 13:26.840
I need you, Philomela.

13:34.490 --> 13:36.060
I feel gross.

13:37.380 --> 13:40.160
Something's slimy.

13:40.790 --> 13:41.760
Are you all right?

13:42.590 --> 13:43.770
Chise.

13:43.770 --> 13:45.620
Are <i>you</i> all right?

13:45.620 --> 13:46.380
Yeah.

13:47.590 --> 13:49.020
What is this?

13:49.020 --> 13:50.800
What happened here?

13:50.800 --> 13:53.300
She's been absorbing magic power, I think.

13:54.030 --> 13:58.200
Philomela lost control and 
consumed our entire bodies.

13:58.200 --> 14:00.400
We were disassembled for a moment.

14:00.650 --> 14:02.030
Disassembled...

14:02.030 --> 14:08.220
W-Well, we were able to find all 
of our own pieces by ourselves.

14:08.220 --> 14:09.530
That's how we got back.

14:09.930 --> 14:12.310
We were re-materialized?

14:12.310 --> 14:13.210
I think so.

14:13.210 --> 14:15.540
I'm dry now, but it's still all over me.

14:16.210 --> 14:18.950
I'm going to go look for Philomela.

14:18.950 --> 14:19.980
The two of you...

14:19.980 --> 14:22.120
"Stay put because it's dangerous?"

14:22.570 --> 14:26.390
I still haven't gotten an answer out of her.

14:26.660 --> 14:28.260
You're right.

14:28.260 --> 14:30.620
We were interrupted last time.

14:32.220 --> 14:33.460
All right.

14:33.460 --> 14:35.340
Let's go ask her properly this time, then.

14:37.830 --> 14:43.480
Today, my son, your father, comes home.

14:43.840 --> 14:46.230
With the magic power you've gathered.

14:46.230 --> 14:48.990
With the blood running through your veins.

14:49.440 --> 14:51.800
He's coming home.

14:51.800 --> 14:56.510
I could bring your mother 
back too, you know.

14:57.050 --> 14:59.370
Now, I've prepared everything.

15:00.020 --> 15:01.200
Come.

15:01.530 --> 15:04.780
Come, Philomela.

15:09.790 --> 15:13.270
<i>I have no freedom.</i>

15:13.710 --> 15:15.690
<i>I don't need a will of my own.</i>

15:16.140 --> 15:19.620
<i>Nothing I do matters.</i>

15:20.510 --> 15:24.440
<i>I'm not allowed anything.</i>

15:28.340 --> 15:29.310
<i>But...</i>

15:32.600 --> 15:35.280
<i>But... But...</i>

15:35.280 --> 15:38.430
What did you want to do, Philomela?

15:40.130 --> 15:43.020
<i>Is all of that really true?</i>

15:51.860 --> 15:59.150
Are you really going to grant my wish 
and bring back my mother and father?

16:03.170 --> 16:06.350
Hey, do you know where she is?

16:06.350 --> 16:06.990
Yeah.

16:07.610 --> 16:09.140
I can follow it now.

16:09.960 --> 16:12.240
I can follow the scent of her soul.

16:18.270 --> 16:19.320
Guards.

16:23.360 --> 16:26.000
Your wishes don't matter to me.

16:27.420 --> 16:30.840
I need proof that he existed.

16:31.320 --> 16:33.330
I'm not adequate on my own.

16:33.830 --> 16:37.090
I need an iron clamp to hold him here.

16:38.880 --> 16:43.860
I have you, his daughter, to be a sacrifice.

16:44.980 --> 16:46.020
A sacrifice...

16:46.620 --> 16:49.220
You were a good girl.

16:49.220 --> 16:52.090
You did as you were told.

16:52.090 --> 16:56.610
You focused on gathering magic 
power from many people.

16:56.890 --> 17:02.530
You didn't even try to find out how 
I was going to use that power.

17:04.600 --> 17:09.870
You faithfully, almost foolishly, 
carried out your task.

17:10.240 --> 17:12.740
You truly are <i>such</i> a good girl.

17:21.650 --> 17:24.490
<i>I didn't even want to think...</i>

17:25.700 --> 17:32.110
<i>about why I couldn't remember 
Mother and Father.</i>

17:32.750 --> 17:38.420
<i>She must have deemed it unnecessary for me.</i>

17:39.960 --> 17:43.050
<i>That's the kind of person she is.</i>

17:52.130 --> 17:56.280
Here, now, is what is needed 
to summon the master.

18:00.050 --> 18:01.430
<i>It was all pointless.</i>

18:01.920 --> 18:03.450
<i>All of it.</i>

18:14.590 --> 18:20.370
<i>Everything I've done until now 
was so that I would die.</i>

18:21.340 --> 18:25.870
<i>Even though I'm the only 
one who carries her blood.</i>

18:28.410 --> 18:30.120
<i>I wanted to be loved.</i>

18:30.940 --> 18:32.620
<i>I wanted approval.</i>

18:34.630 --> 18:37.640
<i>That's all I wanted.</i>

18:39.750 --> 18:46.060
<i>I held hope, I was disappointed, 
 I gave up, and I submitted.</i>

18:46.680 --> 18:48.740
<i>And then part of me held hope again.</i>

18:49.150 --> 18:51.530
<i>But it was for nothing.</i>

18:51.950 --> 18:54.960
<i>I have no one.</i>

18:57.190 --> 18:58.640
Do you want to go on?

18:58.640 --> 18:59.890
Or do you not?

19:00.870 --> 19:02.700
I'll help until you decide.

19:06.810 --> 19:07.820
Philomela!

19:12.340 --> 19:13.370
Guards.

19:14.790 --> 19:16.420
Elias! Ruth!

19:19.540 --> 19:21.590
You can't stop me.

19:21.590 --> 19:23.980
The price has already been paid.

19:23.980 --> 19:24.750
Philomela!

19:25.110 --> 19:28.930
If it's your wish, we can't stop it.

19:29.260 --> 19:30.890
What do you want to happen to you?

19:32.450 --> 19:33.270
Whatever!

19:33.270 --> 19:36.390
Just finish what you were about to say!

19:37.750 --> 19:41.410
That's why we're here, Philomela.

19:44.710 --> 19:46.720
Who's she again?

19:45.710 --> 19:47.660
You're good at this kind of thing.

19:46.880 --> 19:50.380
She has no desires.

19:52.070 --> 19:54.520
I have no one.

19:56.840 --> 19:59.180
You're such a good teacher.

19:59.180 --> 20:00.600
You don't look fine at all.

20:00.600 --> 20:02.410
But you're allowed to speak up now.

20:02.410 --> 20:03.250
Say what you want.

20:03.250 --> 20:05.940
<i>Friends and enemies walk 
amongst each other.</i>

20:03.370 --> 20:06.730
<i>What you want others to do for you.</i>

20:05.940 --> 20:08.800
<i>and all you can do is to 
shout for what you want.</i>

20:07.040 --> 20:08.890
What exactly do you want?

20:08.890 --> 20:10.050
What's your wish?

20:12.180 --> 20:17.210
If I may wish...

20:23.830 --> 20:25.260
Help me!

20:31.080 --> 20:33.760
You ought not be so quick 
to touch that thing.

20:34.200 --> 20:36.690
It absorbs everything.

20:36.690 --> 20:38.160
What do we do, then?!

20:38.160 --> 20:41.770
Chise, you used your magic 
to solve that puzzle.

20:41.770 --> 20:44.390
That puzzle had all kinds 
of sorcery cast on it.

20:44.390 --> 20:45.830
With just one magic!

20:46.730 --> 20:50.460
Isaac, can I use that tool from earlier?

20:50.460 --> 20:51.890
Uh, yeah!

20:52.750 --> 20:55.290
Hold the image of what 
you want in your mind!

20:56.040 --> 20:57.590
A staff won't do.

20:58.030 --> 21:00.640
I need something stronger, sharper...

21:04.720 --> 21:06.190
Go, get it done.

21:07.580 --> 21:11.420
Coffin lock, I am your iron stake.

21:12.030 --> 21:14.560
By the howls of the beasts of the underworld,

21:14.560 --> 21:20.420
you burn away into the fields, and 
I place my hand on the coffin!

21:40.640 --> 21:43.700
That circle was meant to summon a deity...

21:43.700 --> 21:45.740
How could it have been 
stopped by mere magic?

21:56.430 --> 22:00.770
Sorry to keep you waiting, Philomela.

22:01.620 --> 22:06.530
You're the ones who 
helped me gather myself.

22:10.000 --> 22:11.130
Chise...

22:13.590 --> 22:21.750
I never realized I've always 
wanted someone to help me.
